==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Primeape|107}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion. The [[Icerend Shrine]] is featured in the illustration.
*{{m|Rage}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Primeape}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

